  "description": "Shared kernel for the Universal.Operative.Sdk family: content Block model, ITool/ToolResult/ToolDefinition/ToolChoice, Usage, IDiagnosticSink. Provider/execution-model neutral -- pair with Universal.Operative.Sdk.Discrete (turn-based) or Universal.Operative.Sdk.Realtime (duplex-stream).",
