  "readmeFile": "Package.md",
  "releaseNotes": "5.0.0 — BREAKING: this package is now a shared kernel only. Everything turn-shaped (IOperative, Operative, OperativeBuilder, IOperativeFactory/OperativeFactory, IEngine/Engine/EngineBuilder, IModel, Conversation, Message, EngineEvent and its subtypes, StreamEvent/StreamEvents, the transformer pipeline, AgentTool) moved to the new Universal.Operative.Sdk.Discrete package, namespace Universal.Operative.Sdk.Discrete. What remains here (ITool, Tool<TArgs>, ToolResult, ToolDefinition, ToolChoice, the Block hierarchy, Source, Citation, Usage, IDiagnosticSink, the baseline/filesystem/shell tool implementations) is unchanged in namespace and behavior. Add a reference to Universal.Operative.Sdk.Discrete (or .Realtime) alongside this package depending on which execution model you need.",
